    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062440/extras/c2a439a04e430172ce540759057a7e8c.poster.avif?t=1727700647\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062440/extras/c2a439a04e430172ce540759057a7e8c.webm?t=1727700647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062440/extras/c2a439a04e430172ce540759057a7e8c.mp4?t=1727700647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>JAZZ OUT</strong><br>JAZZ OUT is a blood-pumping speedrunning FPS platformer where you use enemies as platforms! Punch guards into the air then jump off their heads to gain momentum. Chain gravity-defying combos, master unique moves, and race against time. Perfect your escape and top the global leaderboard!<br><br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\ud83d\udc5f10 handcrafted, fast, and challenging levels<br></li><li>\ud83d\udd58About 1 hour of gameplay (unlimited, if you're up for challenge)<br></li><li>\ud83c\udfc6Perfect your time and be #1 in global leaderboard!<br></li><li>\ud83c\udfb6Get Jazzed up while you escape the prison!</li></ul>",
